  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "### Why is it Important? \n\nProviding training and development opportunities is one way to enhance the structural empowerment of staff. **The following ideas may be useful in fostering professional development:**\n\n- Support structures and processes which ensure staff can actively participate in organizational decision-making groups such as councils and committees\n\n- Support staff involvement in professional organizations\n\n- Offer tuition reimbursement or assistance for staff enrolled in college or educational programs\n\n- Support conference attendance and additional educational opportunities (e.g., certifications) for staff",
